  "modules": [
    {
      "id": "uniequip_001_rfalcn",
      "name": {
        "en": "Kestrel's Badge",
        "zh": "红隼证章",
        "isMachineTranslation": false
      },
      "type": "INITIAL",
      "typeName2": "",
      "icon": "uniequip_001_rfalcn",
      "description": {
        "en": "Operator Kestrel has demonstrated a remarkable aptitude for preemptive penetration of the battlefield situation and active offense so as to secure leeway for deployment.\nThis operator shall hereby be appointed a Vanguard Operator during field operations to exercise Pioneer responsibilities.\nIn witness whereof,\nThis badge is hereby conferred upon the above named.",
        "zh": "干员红隼擅长抢先切入战局，通过进攻争取部署空间\n根据外勤部门决议\n在外勤任务中划分为先锋干员，行使尖兵职责\n特别颁发此证章\n以兹证明",
        "isMachineTranslation": false
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "uniequip_002_rfalcn",
      "name": {
        "en": "Intimidator",
        "zh": "威吓者",
        "isMachineTranslation": false
      },
      "type": "ADVANCED",
      "typeName2": "Y",
      "icon": "uniequip_002_rfalcn",
      "description": {
        "en": "Making distance from a ruin they personally set alight, Kestrel takes her group back to their initial gathering point. The fire rages on, and even when the skies open up, the rain can't even touch the flames before it steams away midair, leaving only the sound of crackling.\nBreaking the silence, someone asks Kestrel. 'Boss, how many did you kill today?'\n'Can't remember.'\n'Who would remember after the heat of battle how many they killed, youngster?' a weary voice adds. 'To survive is already a job well done.'\nKestrel lets the topic lapse, but that twisted face comes to mind. The one of an 'old acquaintance' scared shitless. The one she closed in on with every step. The one with no alternative but to jump from the roof. The one who left her only that face, one moment before melting into the sea of flames.\nShe knew who that was. The assassin who murdered her friend.\n'Still, this victory's worth celebrating. Today, we wiped out a few more of the killers who slaughtered our people.' Kestrel comes to a stop, looks back, sees the descendants she's brought along. The distant flames flicker in her eyes.\nThey raise a cheer, but Kestrel doesn't smile.\n'So how many killers to go?' asks again the one who broke the silence.\nKestrel gazes over. It's a girl, still young. If the tribe still was, she would never be part of these fighters. She would be living her youth, a bright one, a happy one.\nOh. That's right. She doesn't even have a 'tooth mark'.\n'You showed a great display today. I've now decided you should be rewarded with a 'tooth mark.' Kestrel fails to directly answer the girl's question. 'While we return, you can think about what style of mark you'd like.'\n'Really?'\nA feeling hits Kestrel. She's had this conversation. She was the girl before her. She, the girl, before the tribe's chief, the one who raised her—the one who was dearest to her, the one who outlined, over her left shoulder, the very first band of her 'tooth mark'.\nKestrel can't help but hug that shoulder tight, the warm memory almost abating the cold rainy eve, but it's only a moment before she comes to. For they, stood in the rain, are waiting for her.\n'Really—now let's get back to the gathering point quick. I'll find the box, and then you'll be able to choose.'\nThe group begins to slowly move, their figures gradually melting into the dark of night, never to be seen again.",
        "zh": "红隼正带队远离一片由她们亲手点燃的废墟，走回最初的集结点。火焰熊熊，从天而降的雨滴甚至来不及碰到烈焰便蒸发殆尽，空气中只剩噼啪作响的灼烧声。\n“老大，今天你杀了多少？”有人打破沉默，对红隼发问。\n“记不清了。”\n“年轻人，谁会在战斗后记住自己杀了多少呢？”另外一个疲惫的声音响起，“能活下来就已经很不错了。”\n红隼没再搭话，但她想起了那张扭曲的脸，它属于一个惊慌失措的“老熟人”，在她的步步紧逼下，他迫不得已纵身从楼顶跃下，只留给她那张即将与火海融为一体的脸。\n她认识他，那个杀死她朋友的凶手。\n“不过这次胜利值得庆祝，我们今天又解决了几个曾经残害我们同胞的凶手。”红隼停下脚步，转头对着她带来的那些后辈，远处的火焰在她的双眸中闪闪发光。\n人们发出了欢呼声，但红隼没有笑。\n“那我们还有多少凶手要解决？”那个打破了沉默的声音又响起来。\n红隼望了过去，那是一个稚气未脱的姑娘，如果部族还在，她就不应该出现在战斗的队伍里，而应该享受美好的青春时光。\n哦对了，她连“齿痕”都没有。\n“你今天表现得非常好，我决定将‘齿痕’作为奖品奖励给你。”红隼并没有正面回答姑娘的问题，“在回去的路上，你可以想一想要什么样式的纹路。”\n“真的吗？”\n红隼突然感觉，这样的对话似曾相识，只不过她才是对面的那个女孩，而站在自己位置上的那个人，是亲手将她带大的部族首领——曾经红隼最亲的那个人，为自己在左臂上勾勒了“齿痕”的第一笔纹路。\n红隼忍不住抱了抱自己的左臂，温暖的回忆似乎阻隔了雨夜的寒冷，但她很快清醒过来，因为站在雨中的她们正在等着自己。\n“真的——我们还是早点回集结点吧，我去把那个盒子找出来，然后你就可以挑了。”\n队伍开始慢慢移动起来，她们的身形逐渐融化在黑夜中，再也看不清分毫。",
        "isMachineTranslation": false
      },
